245
00:09:12,301 --> 00:09:13,219
Tira otra vez.

246
00:09:13,302 --> 00:09:15,012
Venga, un tres.

247
00:09:15,096 --> 00:09:16,180
- Dos.
- Bien.

248
00:09:17,306 --> 00:09:18,599
- Ha vuelto.
- Avanzas dos.

249
00:09:18,683 --> 00:09:20,184
Dong-jae, tira el dado.

250
00:09:23,271 --> 00:09:25,189
- Sacas cárcel y no sales.
