253
00:09:29,068 --> 00:09:30,987
- No te enfades.
- Lo sé.

254
00:09:31,070 --> 00:09:32,071
Siguiente, See-won.

255
00:09:33,698 --> 00:09:35,700
Sacas un tres y no sales.

256
00:09:35,783 --> 00:09:36,659
Yeon-woo.

257
00:09:38,661 --> 00:09:39,662
- Cárcel.
- Lo sabía.

258
00:09:39,745 --> 00:09:41,163
- Vas a la cárcel.
- Es experta.

259
00:09:41,247 --> 00:09:42,290
